    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated in the luxurious Heritage Golf & Spa Resort in Killenard, Co. Laois this beautifully presented three/four -bedroom semi-detached home, ideally positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac setting within the popular Killenard development.This spacious family home offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout, with bright and welcoming living spaces designed to provide both comfort and practicality.The property benefits from a generous kitchen/dining area, excellent reception accommodation, and three/four well-sized bedrooms.The master bedroom is particularly impressive, featuring a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while the main bathroom is finished with fully tiled walls and flooring.Externally, the property enjoys a neat and attractive frontage with a cobble lock driveway providing ample off-street parking, along with a mature, private rear garden.Located in the sought after village of Killenard, the property is ideally placed for access to local amenities, schools, shops and recreational facilities, while also offering excellent connectivity to surrounding towns and Dublin.Early viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the space, quality and excellent location this wonderful home has to offer."
      },
